## gstack

Adapted, not vendored (since ytstack 0.6.0; a git subtree at vendor/gstack/
from 0.1.x to 0.2.0, a required install from 0.3.0 to 0.5.0). Source
repository: <https://github.com/garrytan/gstack>

License: MIT. Copyright (c) 2026 Garry Tan.

Six ytstack skills are adaptations of the gstack skills of the same name:
skills/office-hours/, skills/plan-ceo-review/, skills/plan-eng-review/,
skills/retro/, skills/ship/, skills/document-release/. They contain text
derived from gstack's SKILL.md and sections files, restructured for ytstack
and stripped of gstack's runtime; each records the gstack release it was
last synced to in its `metadata.upstream` field. No gstack code, helper or
binary is shipped.

